{"4462130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LOVE D3ATH LOVE", "steam_appid": 4462130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your AI just sent out 3,000+ job applications—WITHOUT ASKING YOU!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s 2222, automation swallowed the whole world. Jobs hardly exist. You are just one of the normals—another unemployed citizen in a system run by machines. <strong>But your job application changes everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, <strong>three beautiful and powerful women</strong> seek you out. Each of them claims you belong by her side, though none of them reveal their true motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They each have a reason that sounds fair. But something doesn't add up—and the closer you get, the less any of it makes sense. Their ambitions push and pull you into different stories and conflicts, and somehow you're in the middle of everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is this really about a job? Or were you chosen for something else?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As events unfold, <strong>the truth behind this automated world—and your unexpected role within it—gradually comes to light.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narrative visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three heroine routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven relationship changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivalries, alliances, and hidden intentions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462130/extras/acad7802bd4b9e414426e7fec5417621.poster.avif?t=1785660967\" aria-label=\"ira\" width=900 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462130/extras/acad7802bd4b9e414426e7fec5417621.webm?t=1785660967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462130/extras/acad7802bd4b9e414426e7fec5417621.mp4?t=1785660967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ira</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supreme Commander of the Merina Empire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A legendary military leader who commands the armed forces of the Merina Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct, fearless, and brutally honest, Ira believes strength decides everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To her, you may be a weapon—or something far more important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462130/extras/04123ffafa1723ec713e5f6fc1222a13.poster.avif?t=1785660967\" aria-label=\"riika\" width=900 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462130/extras/04123ffafa1723ec713e5f6fc1222a13.webm?t=1785660967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462130/extras/04123ffafa1723ec713e5f6fc1222a13.mp4?t=1785660967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Riika</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CEO of Byakuran Corporation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The young and brilliant head of the Byakuran megacorporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant, calculating, and always in control, Riika treats the world like a game of strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But for some reason, she wants <strong>you</strong> close to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462130/extras/991284e0fe3ec0a69c15d2a0bbf7bcc9.poster.avif?t=1785660967\" aria-label=\"sao\" width=900 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462130/extras/991284e0fe3ec0a69c15d2a0bbf7bcc9.webm?t=1785660967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462130/extras/991284e0fe3ec0a69c15d2a0bbf7bcc9.mp4?t=1785660967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sao</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Director of the Oro Research Institute</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet and obsessive scientist who studies the boundaries between humanity and technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sao doesn’t see you as an employee or an ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She sees you as <strong>a question waiting to be answered</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Elements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story spanning <strong>multiple eras and timelines</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character profiles update</strong> as new secrets are revealed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden connections between characters and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery behind the world of 2222</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your AI just sent out 3,000+ job applications—WITHOUT ASKING YOU!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s 2222, automation swallowed the whole world. Jobs hardly exist. You are just one of the normals—another unemployed citizen in a system r